WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.460
Evening at home. A mother asks her son about his homework.

2
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.950
Odrobiłeś lekcje?

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.920
Jeszcze nie. Odrabiam je teraz.

4
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.910
Right now, a process: the imperfective verb.

5
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.880
Kiedy skończysz?

6
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.570
Skończę za pół godziny.

7
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.280
One finished action in the future: the perfective verb.

8
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.030
Wczoraj przeczytałem całą książkę.

9
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.950
Most verbs come in pairs.

10
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:41.340
One describes a process or a habit, the other one finished action with a result.

11
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:48.420
Kuba is doing his homework right now. What does he say?

12
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.240
Jeszcze nie. Odrabiam je teraz.

13
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.600
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

14
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.720
Jeszcze nie. Odrabiam je teraz.

15
00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:08.120
He will finish in half an hour. What does he say?

16
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.660
Skończę za pół godziny.

17
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:17.020
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

18
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:20.860
Skończę za pół godziny.

19
00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.420
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
